    "_postman_id": "7d87e7ca-156a-4db1-b4a3-e2490a73bb94",
    "name": "Wompi Merchants Payment Sources API",
    "description": "Wompi is the payment gateway of Grupo Bancolombia, serving Colombia (COP). The REST API creates and tracks transactions across local payment methods - CARD, NEQUI (mobile wallet), PSE (Pagos Seguros en Linea / online bank debit), BANCOLOMBIA_TRANSFER (Boton Bancolombia), and BANCOLOMBIA_COLLECT - plus card and Nequi tokenization, reusable payment sources, and hosted payment links. Public-key endpoints are safe for the browser; private-key endpoints are server-side only.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Wompi Soporte\n Email: soporte@wompi.co",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "createdAt": "2026-07-28T03:31:34.000Z",
